IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `il41-nouns`
IMPORT `il41-amendment`

-- TESTS for s 16.  Facts: the instruction is the Hebrew "at its end shall come"; s 4 of the State as Litigant Law is read from the page image of Sefer HaChukim 251 p. 119.
-- The footnote and the number of the amendment: the Law's heading says No. 3; two amendments precede it; footnote 2 cites two publications.

§ `Tests: s 16`

#ASSERT `the amendment s 16 makes`'s `the section amended` EQUALS "4"

#ASSERT count `the amendments before s 16` EQUALS 2
#ASSERT `the number the heading of s 16 gives this amendment` EQUALS (count `the amendments before s 16`) PLUS 1
#ASSERT count `the publications footnote 2 of the Law cites` EQUALS 2
#ASSERT `the original publication of the State as Litigant Law`'s `the page` EQUALS 118
#ASSERT `the second amendment of the State as Litigant Law`'s `the page` EQUALS 920
#ASSERT `the first amendment of the State as Litigant Law`'s `the Hebrew year` EQUALS 5759
